    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60000 years in the future , the old empire is on the brink of collapse. You and five other pilots are the last thing standing between a dying way of life and total annihilation. Shoot command and bomb your way through multiple unique stages, you are our last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system that allows you to play as an entire squad at the same time by switching ships and commanding bombers that unleash a devastating screen-clearing attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless and boss rush mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with a unique sense of speed and style, you can learn each enemy's weaknesses and which ship is best suited to counter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10  stages each containing a unique boss and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite lives/lives mode, you can play this game like an old arcade cabinet or you can go through each level at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is in its early stages content is likely to Change/not end up in the final game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60000 years in the future , the old empire is on the brink of collapse. You and five other pilots are the last thing standing between a dying way of life and total annihilation. Shoot command and bomb your way through multiple unique stages, you are our last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system that allows you to play as an entire squad at the same time by switching ships and commanding bombers that unleash a devastating screen-clearing attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless and boss rush mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with a unique sense of speed and style, you can learn each enemy's weaknesses and which ship is best suited to counter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10  stages each containing a unique boss and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite lives/lives mode, you can play this game like an old arcade cabinet or you can go through each level at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is in its early stages content is likely to Change/not end up in the final game.</p>",
